# What the build context leaves behind. The first block is load-bearing rather than hygiene:
# those paths are gitignored, so they are absent from the repository a directory clones and
# builds, but they are present in a working tree — where `COPY . .` would bake them into the
# image. The rest is build output that would either bloat the context or contradict the
# container's own restore.

.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
nupkg/
TestResults/
*.user

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
